<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>
	<HugsLib.UpdateFeatureDef Abstract="true" Name="UpdateFeatureBase">
		<modNameReadable>EcoTech</modNameReadable>
		<modIdentifier>RadiantAlchemics.EcoTech</modIdentifier>
		<linkUrl>https://ludeon.com/forums/index.php?topic=37161.0</linkUrl>
	</HugsLib.UpdateFeatureDef>
		<HugsLib.UpdateFeatureDef ParentName="UpdateFeatureBase">
		<defName>RA_EcoTech_1_3_0</defName>
		<assemblyVersion>1.3.0</assemblyVersion>
		<content>Update 1.3.0

NEW MECHANICS:
 o Terraplant Infusion: Infuse plants with different terrasaps while they are growing to change what they'll ultimately grow into.
 o Bio-Alchemization: Utilize powerful (and macabre) lithic terratech to turn flesh into pure silver and gold.
NEW TERRATECH PATH EXPANSIONS:
 o Stellar Path: A new path that focuses on stellar energies. Introductory.
 o Bloomwood: A new genome focused on turning biotic mass into various flora.
 o Periwood: Can now be further utilized using a process called Heartshifting.
 o Metal Reclamation: You can now recycle captured and scavenged gear into it's it's base metals.
 o Lithic Aptitude: Lithic research has been expanded to allow further, and stronger, development.
FIRST LITHIC PRIMARY CLASS - MIDAS:
 o Midas-Class focuses on giving a dedicated use for silver, gold, and machined items you may end up stockpiling.
 o Midas-Class weaponry, which utilizes valuable metals as an damage source with extreme potential.
 o Midas-Class conditions, which converts body parts into as variety of solid valuable metals.
 o Midas-Class structures, which melts down items into gold, silver, or even other unique, highly valuable alloys.
 o This class will certainly expand later, and give more use cases for melting down your riches.
NEW ITEMS:
 o Two new armors: Periheart and Genesite armor
 o Waylight Rifle, a Stellar path upgradable rifle
 o Bloomrot Staff, a melee weapon that inflicts Bloomrot
 o Several new sap-infused weapons
OTHER:
 o Scenario overhaul, which adds some exclusive benefits, such as powerful traits and starting gear.
 o Tech progression overhaul.
 o Major rebalancing of many weapons, structures, and items.
 o Major tweaking of terrasap distribution.
 O MANY oversight and typo changes.
 o Several texture overhauls.

--See mod discord announcements for all the update details! - https://discord.gg/ksksHj --
		</content>
	</HugsLib.UpdateFeatureDef>	

